          <li><strong>Underestimating working capital.</strong> First order + customs duties + marketing = 4x the unit cost in cash needed before you see a single sale.</li>
          <li><strong>Skipping the sample round.</strong> "Looks the same on screen" costs 6-8 weeks of rework. Always approve a physical hand-loom sample before bulk.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

